---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: end()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_ended: caller is Legion operator OR projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_not_ended --> q_set_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_not_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale already ended
    q_set_ended --> q_set_time: hasEnded = true
    q_set_time --> q_emit: endTime = block.timestamp
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleConcluded(endTime)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded

    note right of q_set_ended
        INV-001: hasEnded is monotonic false->true
        INV-002: no predetermined endTime; set at conclusion
        INV-003: invest() disabled after end()
        INV-004: per-investor refund windows already running from invest time
    end note
